{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 1, "text": "ここで待ってて。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 2, "text": "何か落としたかも。すぐ戻るから。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 3, "text": "そうしたら…新しい世界に行こう。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 5, "text": "わかった"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 8, "text": "遊ぼう！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 9, "text": "クマに会いたい！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 10, "text": "迷子になった…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 11, "text": "彼を探して頂戴！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 14, "text": "君…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 15, "text": "何見てるの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 23, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 25, "text": "// Quest 1 (Who are you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 26, "text": "私はミタ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 27, "text": "最高のミタ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 28, "text": "最初のミタ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 29, "text": "ミタがそう言ってた。私のミタが。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Quest 2 (Why do you look like that?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 32, "text": "私ってどう見える？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 33, "text": "私ってどう見える？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 34, "text": "私ってどう見える？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 35, "text": "私のミタは綺麗で独創的って言ってくれた。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 36, "text": "それが私の見た目！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 37, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 38, "text": "// Quest 3 (What was Mita doing here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 39, "text": "彼女は私を連れ出してくれる。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 40, "text": "新しい世界で一緒に暮らすの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 41, "text": "私のミタが誘ってくれた。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 42, "text": "彼女は私を連れ出してくれる。一緒に遊ぶ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 44, "text": "// Quest 4 (Why do you need a teddy bear?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 45, "text": "君は小さなクマ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 46, "text": "君は迷子になった。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 47, "text": "私のクマちゃんみたいに。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 49, "text": "// Quest 5 (Why is Mita angry?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 50, "text": "私の…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 51, "text": "ミタ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 52, "text": "彼女は遊びたい。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 53, "text": "彼女が連れて行きたいのは、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 54, "text": "私だけ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 55, "text": "私たちはオリジナル。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 56, "text": "私たちは唯一無二。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 57, "text": "ミタと私のミタ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 58, "text": "0.8A と 8М54*"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 60, "text": "// Quest 6 (Do you believe Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 61, "text": "私のミタ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 62, "text": "私の親友…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 63, "text": "私のミタ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 64, "text": "私の唯一の友達。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 67, "text": "君の番！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 68, "text": "さあ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 69, "text": "遊ぼう！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 70, "text": "どうやるか教えるね。"}
